    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "12 runs scheduled, Tue/Thu/Sat through Oct 17:\n\n- **Wk1** (Sept 22/24/26): 8x 60s run/90s walk\n- **Wk2** (Sept 29–Oct 3): 6x 90s run/2min walk\n- **Wk3** (Oct 6–10): 2x (90s run/90s walk + 3min run/3min walk)\n- **Wk4** (Oct 13–17): 3min/5min/3min/5min run blocks, shrinking walk breaks\n\nAll ~5min warmup/cooldown walk included. Run pace: conversational, don't chase speed. Rest days between runs — that's the plan, not optional; running fitness builds on the walk-break days too. If any run feels too easy, hold the prescribed intervals anyway — consistency matters more than pushing early."
